* Physical Behavioral Model for LTC6994 (RC-Damped, No Transmission Lines)
* Pins: 1=VCC, 2=GND, 3=SET, 4=IN, 5=DIV, 6=OUT

.SUBCKT LTC6994 VCC GND SET IN DIV OUT

* 1. Physical Input Pins
C_IN IN GND 3.5P
R_IN IN GND 100MEG

* 2. Smooth Comparator (Evaluates input pulse)
E_COMP COMP_INT GND TABLE { V(IN) - V(GND) } = (0, 0) (1.3, 0) (1.5, 3.3) (5, 3.3)

* 3. Lumped RC Delay Stage (~50 ns delay with finite slew rate)
R_DEL COMP_INT DELAY_NODE 500
C_DEL DELAY_NODE GND 100P

* 4. Output Stage Buffer with CMOS Series Resistance (30 Ohm)
E_OUT_BUF OUT_INT GND TABLE { V(DELAY_NODE) } = (0, 0) (1.0, 0) (1.5, 3.3) (5, 3.3)
R_OUT OUT_INT OUT 30
C_OUT OUT GND 10P

* 5. Configuration Pins
R_SET SET GND 1E9
R_DIV DIV GND 1E9

.ENDS LTC6994
